OL,3,GNEWSARiver of Light opening night
OL,4,Acalled off due to high winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opening night of the River of Light
OL,7,Ffestival has been cancelled because of
OL,8,Fhigh winds caused by Storm Austen.
OL,10,FLiverpool City Council said Friday's
OL,11,Fevents had been called off "in the
OL,12,Finterests of safety" due to
OL,13,Fdeteriorating weather conditions.
OL,15,FA spokesperson said: "Please keep an
OL,16,Feye on our social channels for any
OL,17,Ffurther event updates over the
OL,18,Fweekend."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
